Let's Be Rational, by Peter Jäckel, revision 1.0.0.1520 (2024-02-09), taken unchanged from
www.jaeckel.org/LetsBeRational.7z, except that dllmain.h is reduced to the export macro and
normaldistribution.cpp spells one function name with "_half" for "½", which C++ does not accept
in an identifier, and lets_be_rational.cpp names one macro parameter "beta" for "𝛽", which clang 18
rejects.

